gtw(){return"What are the general tax implications?"},
gtx(){return"Tax implications (capital gains, distributions, etc.) depend heavily on your individual circumstances, entity type (individual, corporate), and the tax laws of your jurisdiction. We provide relevant reporting documents, but we strongly advise consulting your local tax professional."},
gtu(){return"When are tax documents provided?"},
